Demonstrates advanced span manipulation capabilities provided by the OpenTelemetrySpanExt trait in Rust. This allows for direct setting of attributes, span status, adding events with custom timestamps and attributes, and linking to other spans. It extends the functionality of standard tracing spans with OpenTelemetry-specific features. Dependencies include opentelemetry and tracing crates.

